Attribution

Wincy is an independent Windows implementation inspired by Maccy
(https://github.com/p0deje/Maccy), the macOS clipboard manager by Alex
Rodionov, which is also MIT licensed.

Wincy reproduces Maccy's behaviour and interaction design. It contains none of
its source code: Maccy is written in Swift against AppKit and SwiftUI, while
Wincy is written from scratch in C# against WPF and the Win32 API.

